<section>

   <section>
       <h2>Tools to use in the browser</h2>
       <ul>
           <li><a href="https://developer.chrome.com/docs/devtools">Built in devtools</a></li>

           <li><a href="https://chrispederick.com/work/web-developer/">Web developer plugin for Chrome et Firefox</a></li>
           <li><a href="https://accessibility-bookmarklets.org/install.html">Accessibility bookmarklets</a></li>
       </ul>

   </section>  
   <section>
       <h2>Devtools</h2>
       <ul>
           <li>Right click on an element and select "inspect"</li>
           <li>Ctrl + shift + C</li>
           <li>F12 </li>
       </ul>
   </section>

   <section>
       <h2>Web developer plugin</h2>
       <ul>
           <li><a href="https://chrispederick.com/work/web-developer/">Install the plugin</a></li>
           <li>Open it by clicking on the cogwheel icon</li>
           <li>Examples of use : display alt texts, outline headings, ... </li>
       </ul>
   </section>

   <section>
       <h2>Bookmarklets</h2>
       <ul>
           <li>Use ctrl + shift + B to display bookmarks bar</li>
           <li>Drag bookmarklets to bookmarks bar</li>
           <li>Click on bookmark to trigger related action</li>
           <li>Examples : display headings, display landmarks ,...</li>
       </ul>
   </section>
</section>
